### Rust ###
# Build output. `target/` reaches ~8 GB after a release build; committing it
# would wreck the repository, so it is ignored here rather than at the root.
/target/
# Staging directory assembled by scripts/build.ps1 before ISCC runs.
/dist/
# Profiler and coverage output.
*.profraw
*.profdata
/coverage/
